hadiths[86]{hadithnumber,text}:
"969","Anas ibn Malik said"
"970","Al-Bara' ibn 'Azib said"
"971","Ibrahim ibn Marzuq ath-Thaqafi related that his father (who had\nbelonged to Allah ibn az-Zubayr) told him"
"972","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah said"
"973","`A'isha"
"974","Ibn 'Umar said"
"975","'Abdu'r-Rahman ibn Razin said"
"976","Anas was asked"
"977","Al-Wazi' ibn 'Amir said"
"978","Suhayb said"
"979","Abu Mijaz said"
"980","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"981","Al-Bara' reported that the Prophet"
"982","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"983","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"984","Bashir ibn Yasar said"
"985","Jabir said"
"986","Ibn 'Umar said that al-Agharr (who was a man from Muzayna and had\nbeen a Companion of the Prophet) was owed some measures of dates by a man\nfrom the Banu 'Amr ibn 'Awf who came to him many times. He said"
"987","Abu Ayyub reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"988","Abu Hurayra reported that a man passed by the Messenger of Allah"
"989","'Umar said"
"990","'A'isha reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"991","Anas reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"992","Ibn Mas'ud said"
"993","Abu Hurayra said"
"994","'Abdu'r-Rahman ibn Shibl said that he heard the Prophet"
"995","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"996","Jabir said"
"997","See 993."
"998","Fadala reported that the Prophet"
"999","Ash-Sha'bi said that he met a rider and gave the greeting first.\nI said"
"1000","See 996."
"1001","See 996."
"1002","See 993."
"1003","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1004","(sic) Abu'z-Zinad said"
"1005","Abu Qurra al-Khurasani said"
"1006","Sa'd reported that he went with 'Abdullah ibn 'Umar and al-Qasim\nibn Muhammad. They stopped at place and 'Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr commanded\nand made a gesture of greeting to them and it was answered."
"1007","'Ata' ibn Abi Rabah said"
"1008","Anas ibn Malik reported that the Companions of the Prophet"
"1009","At-Tufayl ibn Ubayy ibn Ka'b related that he used to visit 'Abdullah\nibn 'Umar and would go with him to the market. He said"
"1010","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1011","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1012","Mu'awiya ibn Qurra said"
"1013","Abu Hurayra said"
"1014","Anas ibn Malik reported that the Companions of the Prophet"
"1015","It is reported by Thabit al-Bannani that Anas used to oil his\nhand with scented oil in the morning for the sake of shaking hands with\nhis brothers."
"1016","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr reported that a man said"
"1017","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1018","Abu Hurayra said"
"1019","Salim"
"1020","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr ibn al-'as said"
"1021","Al-Hasan said"
"1022","'Ali ibn 'Abdullah was heard expressing his dislike for chess\nand said"
"1023","'Ali ibn Abi Talib said"
"1024","Muhammad ibn 'Abdullah reported that a man came to the Prophet"
"1025","Abu Sa'id said"
"1026","'Umar ibn 'Abdu'l-'Aziz asked Abu Bakr ibn Abi Hathama"
"1027","'Ubaydullah ibn 'Abdullah said"
"1028","Jabir said"
"1029","Tamim ibn Hadhlam said"
"1030","Ziyad ibn 'Ubayd (ar-Ru'ayni) said"
"1031","Al-Miqdad ibn al-Aswad said"
"1032","'Umar said to 'Adi ibn Hatim"
"1033","'A'isha said"
"1034","'Ali said"
"1035","'Uqba ibn 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr who said"
"1036","Abu Jamra said"
"1037","Qayla reported that a mans aid"
"1038","Abu Dharr said"
"1039","'A'isha reported"
"1040","Mu'awiya ibn Qurra said that his father said to him"
"1041","'Abdullah ibn as-Samit said"
"1042","'Abdullah said"
"1043","Al-Hasan said"
"1044","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr ibn al-'As said"
"1045","Abu Hurayra said"
"1046","Thabit al-Bannani reported that Anas ibn Malik walked by some\nchildren and greeted them. He said"
"1047","'Anbas said"
"1048","Umm Hani'"
"1049","Al-Hasan said"
"1050","Asma' was heard to say that the Prophet"
"1051","Asma'"
"1052","Tariq said"
"1053","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr reported that a man asked the Messenger of\nAllah"
"1054","Anas said that he was ten years old when the Messenger of Allah"
